# Eureka Pulp Mill pull requests

When the user asks for a change to Eureka Pulp Mill, merge that pull request as soon as the work is finished and checked. Do not wait for a separate approval to merge.

This covers `eureka-pulp-mill/` and pull requests whose changes are for that game. Leave other games' pull requests alone unless the user asks to merge those too.
